---
title: "Pac-Man — Architecture & Flow Diagrams"
---

%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
%%  1. GAME STATE MACHINE
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Menu : Launch game

    Menu --> Playing : Start Game
    Menu --> Highscores : View Highscores
    Menu --> Instructions : View Instructions
    Menu --> [*] : Exit

    Highscores --> Menu : ESC

    Instructions --> Menu : ESC

    Playing --> Paused : ESC / P
    Playing --> EnterName : All lives lost\n(Game Over)
    Playing --> EnterName : All levels cleared\n(Victory)
    Playing --> Playing : Level complete\n→ load next level

    Paused --> Playing : Resume
    Paused --> Menu : Main Menu

    EnterName --> Menu : Save highscore\n(ENTER)

    state Playing {
        direction LR
        [*] --> Alive
        Alive --> DeathPause : Ghost collision\n(lives > 0)
        DeathPause --> Alive : 1s timeout\n→ respawn
        Alive --> Alive : Move / Eat / Collide
    }
